# /docs/build/

# =====================================================
# Do NOT ignore these important files
# =====================================================
# Keep:
# - .gitignore itself
# - README.md
# - LICENSE
# - All .v, .tcl, .xdc source files
# - All SDK source files (.c, .h in src directories)
# - Project.xpr file (can regenerate other files)
# - Bitstream sources if you have them committed separately
# - BIN and BIT files in sd_card directory
# - BOOT.bin for deployment
